# 🎓 StudyFlow AI

> **Stop Switching Between Apps. Start Studying Smarter.**

StudyFlow AI is an AI-powered academic productivity platform built specifically for **university and college students**. It combines assignment assistance, research support, study planning, reminders, and productivity tools into one secure and intelligent workspace.

---

# 🌐 Live Demo

🚀 **Live Application**

https://studyflow-ai-2026.lovable.app

---

# 💻 GitHub Repository

🔗 https://github.com/actaiproject001-create/studyflow-ai-2026

---

# 📖 Problem Statement

University students often rely on multiple applications to manage their academic work.

They use one app for assignments, another for research, another for planning, another for notes, and another for reminders. Constantly switching between these tools wastes time, reduces productivity, and makes studying more stressful.

---

# 💡 Our Solution

StudyFlow AI solves this problem by providing one intelligent platform where students can:

- Complete assignments with AI assistance
- Perform academic research
- Plan their study schedule
- Organize notes and learning resources
- Track academic progress
- Stay productive with smart reminders

Everything is available from one modern dashboard.

---

# 🎯 Target Users

- University Students
- College Students
- Self-Learning Students
- Researchers
- AI-assisted learners

