# 🤖 AI Feature

StudyFlow AI uses Artificial Intelligence as a learning companion rather than simply giving direct answers.

### AI Capabilities

- Explain assignments
- Assist research
- Create study plans
- Generate summaries
- Improve productivity
- Support academic learning

### AI System Instructions

The AI is instructed to:

- Teach concepts instead of encouraging plagiarism.
- Provide structured explanations.
- Promote critical thinking.
- Help students understand rather than memorize.
- Encourage ethical use of AI in education.

