# 🚀 Installation

Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/actaiproject001-create/studyflow-ai-2026.git
```

Go into the project folder

```bash
cd studyflow-ai-2026
```

Install dependencies

```bash
npm install
```

Run the application

```bash
npm run dev
```

