# 🎯 Why StudyFlow AI?

Unlike traditional productivity applications, StudyFlow AI combines multiple academic tools into one AI-powered platform.

Instead of switching between different applications, students can manage their complete academic workflow in one place.

The goal is to help students:

- Study smarter
- Stay organized
- Save time
- Improve productivity
- Learn more effectively

